4. Corrected Accounting Contracts and Formulas
4.1 Authoritative Formulas (ETB Integer Cents Only)
Only non-archived, non-system ETB accounts (isSystem == false && isArchived == false && currencyCode == 'ETB') and non-voided ledger postings (JournalEntriesTable.isVoided == false) participate. Pre-existing non-ETB accounts contribute 0 everywhere and raise review flags.
LiquidCash:
sum(Balance(a)) where a.type == asset && a.subType IN {cash, bank, mobile_money} (Dr - Cr; bank overdrafts < 0 reduce LiquidCash directly).
VaultSavings:
sum(Balance(a)) where a.type == asset && a.subType == savings_vault.
ShortTermCreditOwed:
sum(max(0, Balance(a))) where a.type == liability && a.subType == credit_card (Cr - Dr > 0).
PrepaidCardCredit (Confirmed Option 1):
sum(max(0, -Balance(a))) where a.type == liability && a.subType == credit_card && Balance(a) < 0.
Included in AvailableToSpend(H).
Included in NetFinancialPosition.
Displayed separately in Finance Overview & Breakdown Sheet as Prepaid Card Credit: +X ETB alongside Liquid Cash.
DuePayables(H):
sum(d.outstandingCents) where d.debtType == payable && d.status == active && (d.dueDate == null || d.dueDate <= H) (undated active payables count as due on demand <= H; settled, written_off, voided, and dueDate > H contribute 0).
DueOutflowNonDebtCommitments(H):
sum(max(0, c.amountCents - c.verifiedSettledCents)) where c.direction == outflow && c.linkedDebtId == null && c.status IN {unpaid, partial} && c.dueDate <= H.
Excludes (0): all direction == inflow expected-income commitments, all linkedDebtId != null commitments (preventing payable double-count), dueDate > H, paid, and legacy_unverified_paid.
VirtualSavingsReserve:
sum(max(0, g.currentAllocatedCents)) where g.linkedAccountId == null && g.status != archived. Vault-linked goals (linkedAccountId != null) contribute 0.
AvailableToSpend(H) (Confirmed Option 1 — Zero-Crossing Transfer Invariant):
AvailableToSpend(H) = LiquidCash + PrepaidCardCredit - ShortTermCreditOwed - DuePayables(H) - DueOutflowNonDebtCommitments(H) - VirtualSavingsReserve
(Equivalently, LiquidCash - SignedCreditCardOwed - DuePayables(H) - DueOutflowNonDebtCommitments(H) - VirtualSavingsReserve: paying down or overpaying a credit card from liquid cash preserves AvailableToSpend(H) identically across zero! Negative totals display exact minus sign + ETB in context.daywellColors.error + shortfall banner.)
NetFinancialPosition:
NetFinancialPosition = LiquidCash + VaultSavings + TotalActiveReceivables + PrepaidCardCredit - ShortTermCreditOwed - TotalActivePayables
