3. Universal ON DELETE RESTRICT + App Lifecycle	Enforce RESTRICT in SQLite; separate archive, void, unused-draft delete, and explicit Edit unlink (UPDATE SET NULL).	Blocks accidental silent SET NULL/CASCADE corruption across vault goals, debts & budgets.	Accidental DELETE can still drop links silently or cascade-delete postings/budgets.
4. Overfunded Virtual Goal Reserve	Retain full unlinked currentAllocatedCents (even > targetCents) until withdrawn or released to archive.	AvailableToSpend(H) never jumps unexpectedly when a goal completes or targets shrink.	Cap virtual reserves at min(allocated, target), auto-releasing surplus to spendable cash.
